  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-fried chips from Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The applicant in this project proposal is Saggitario Beheer B.V.. The local partner is Linkline Investments Ltd. The latter is currently in the process of establishing a workable farm. Two other parties involved in this project are Danespo Holland and Den Hartigh B.V.. Both companies are involved in the production and trade of seed potatoes.The aim of this project is to set up a production facility for pre fried chips in combination with a nucleus farm and an outgrower network (consisting of around 70 outgrowers) to produce the potatoes for the chips factory. The project will be located in Nanyuki, central Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
